Melee-NX-NetPlay: offline Squad Strike (Z on the VS character select adds fighters) becomes a player setting, off by default.
melee-unlocked builds the mode into every image (MELEE_SQUAD_STRIKE ON) and turns it on in every ordinary stock VS match; here
gmSquad_ModeAllowed() also asks the host (test_getenv "MU_SQUAD_STRIKE", "1" = on). The frontend says "1" only when settings.ini
has squad_strike 1 and no online session runs (and while a replay plays back); the headless runner answers nothing, so the
reference scripts run with it off (they never press Z on the select). Online Squad Strike rows are upstream's own and unchanged.
